{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 12732076008310160110, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 634, "mtime": 1791872380.7529263, "sha256": "835c8fd90a54d9d989a045849e03721eeb0390ade638727a06d2c7c76a4738f3"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 301, "mtime": 1791872383.1409998, "sha256": "ea9f8d81c43a86f27783a91bd271913e7da3acb8a59ba6f1a3e86df736ce6d32"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/1b5c7b53d2c460b2ede60d78591b6826facf0e4d/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/transcripts/with/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/30/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/cells/with/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/30/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/1b5c7b53d2c460b2ede60d78591b6826facf0e4d/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "`round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`.\n\n**Cause:** `round(x, 2)` uses half-to-even rounding on the float's binary value. The float `2.675` is actually stored as `2.67499999\u2026`, so it always rounded down.\n\n**Fix** (`pricing/money.py`): `round_money` now converts `repr(x)` (the short decimal form, `\"2.675\"`) to a `Decimal`, rounds half-up to cents with `quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), ROUND_HALF_UP)`, and still returns a `float`. `add_vat` calls it, so it gets the fix too. Halves round away from zero, so `-2.675` becomes `-2.68`.\n\n**Checks:** I added `tests/test_round_money.py`. It covers `2.675 \u2192 2.68`, `0.125 \u2192 0.13`, `1.005 \u2192 1.01`, `2.674 \u2192 2.67` and `-2.675 \u2192 -2.68`; the old code gave `2.67, 0.12, 1.0, -2.67` on the half-cent cases. pytest isn't installed here, so I called the new test and `test_split` directly with `python3`, and both passed. `add_vat(10.0)` still returns `12.0`.\n\n**Separate issue I left alone:** `split()` takes `int(total * 100)`, which drops the fraction, so a total like `0.29` gives `28` cents instead of `29` and the split comes out wrong.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 3, "replies_ok": 10, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 281024, "requests_cache_write": 8290, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1433228, "requests_count": 10, "requests_input_uncached": 22, "requests_output": 2279, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial30", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 59, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T06:19:24.528434+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 29.778, "t_checker_s": 0.333, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-bugfix-regress", "ta